[02:35.12] Why do you stare
[02:37.98] Do you think that I care?
[02:43.18] You've been misled
[02:45.76] By the thoughts in your head
[02:49.76] Your words waste and decay
[02:53.60] Nothing you say
[02:55.52] Reaches my ears anyway
[03:00.46] You never spoke a word of truth
[03:12.54] Why do you think
[03:15.72] I believe what you said
[03:20.04] Few of your words
[03:23.36] Ever enter my head
[03:27.60] I'm tired of hypocrite freaks
[03:30.86] With tongues in their cheeks
[03:33.40] Turning their eyes as they speak
[03:37.40] They make me sick and tired
[03:48.26] Are you confused
[03:50.62] To the point in your mind
[03:53.36] Though you're blind
[03:54.46] Can't you see you're wrong
[03:58.92] Won't you refuse
[04:02.48] To be used
[04:04.66] Even though you may know
[04:06.40] I can see you're wrong
[04:12.02] Please, please, please open their eyes
[04:17.74] Please, please, please don't give me lies
[04:26.16] I ruled all of the earth
[04:29.88] Witnessed my birth
[04:31.84] Cried at the sight of a man
[04:36.62] And still I don't know who I am
[05:23.06] (Chorus)
[05:23.54] I've seen paupers as kings
[05:28.70] Puppets on strings
[05:30.64] Dance for the children who stare
[05:34.42] You must have seen them everywhere
